  "Name": "HP Mercury LoadRunner Agent magentproc.exe Remote Command Execution",
  "Description": "This module exploits a remote command execution vulnerablity in HP LoadRunner before 9.50 and also HP Performance Center before 9.50. HP LoadRunner 12.53 and other versions are also most likely vulneable if the (non-default) SSL option is turned off. By sending a specially crafted packet, an attacker can execute commands remotely. The service is vulnerable provided the Secure Channel feature is disabled (default).",
